A||||1||Dick McHaffie||Replacing Door Locks||||1||
Z||000000||Dick McHaffie||01-06-2000||08:08 PM||||My Daughter and I have an 85 GT, and the door locks are shot.<P>The door panels are in excellent shape and I don't want to mess them up.<P>Anybody have step by step process for replacing them?<P>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||ka4nkf||01-06-2000||09:40 PM||||Remove inner door panel, Disconnect the linkage from the lock arm, Then with a pair of neddle nose pliars remove the U shaped clip from the lock. PS dont drop the clip down into the door. Pull out lock and replace in reverse order.||||reg||1
